  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5I8S\r\n\r\nWith the asking price newly lowered, this presents an opportunity to buy in a highly desirable North Shore neighbourhood. This north-facing, top-level apartment in the popular Shoalhaven complex offers sunshine, space and an easy-care lifestyle in a location that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture abundant natural light, the apartment requires absolutely no work—simply move in and enjoy. The interior has been completely repainted, complemented by new basins in both bathrooms and a brand-new shower fitted in the master ensuite. Accommodation comprises two generous double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite. A versatile flexi room offers additional space for a home office, study, nursery or occasional single bedroom, while a second bathroom adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nLife at Shoalhaven offers the ultimate secure, lock-up-and-leave lifestyle. Residents enjoy access to landscaped recreational grounds and a swimming pool, alongside a bookable recreation room ideal for hosting parties and social gatherings with friends. Two designated tandem car parks plus ample visitor parking make day-to-day living and entertaining effortless.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Leave the car at home and take an easy stroll to Takapuna Beach, Lake Pupuke, Shore City Shopping Centre, supermarkets, and the vibrant town centre’s boutique shopping, cafés, and restaurants. A bus stop just down the road and rapid motorway access make city commuting seamless. Families will also appreciate the excellent school zoning, including Takapuna Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls High School and Takapuna Grammar School.\r\n\r\nPriced to sell and ready for immediate possession. Contact us today to arrange your viewing, or visit the upcoming open home.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
